msgstr[0] "%d Konto hat Administratorrechte."
msgstr[1] "%d Konten haben Administratorrechte."

#: includes/checks/class-cascr-checks-accounts.php:265
msgid "The set of administrator accounts is worth reviewing."
msgstr "Die Administratorkonten sind einen prüfenden Blick wert."

#: includes/checks/class-cascr-checks-accounts.php:268
msgid ""
"Give people the lowest role that lets them do their work, and remove "
